        <p source="#source-47808-48848">「いや、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47820-47835"><rb>此</rb><rt>これ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47835-47838">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47838-47853"><rb>惡</rb><rt>わる</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47853-47874">かつた。まあ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47874-47892"><rb>更</rb><rt>あらた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47892-47901">めて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47901-47919"><rb>更</rb><rt>あらた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47919-47925">めて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47925-47946"><rb>御禮</rb><rt>おれい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47946-47949">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47949-47964"><rb>申</rb><rt>まを</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-47964-47982">します。……</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-47982-48006"><rb>實際</rb><rt>じつさい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48006-48009">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48009-48021"><rb>此</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48021-48024">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48024-48045"><rb>手紙</rb><rt>てがみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48045-48048">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48048-48066"><rb>遺失</rb><rt>おと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48066-48075">したと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48075-48087"><rb>氣</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48087-48090">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48090-48102"><rb>附</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48102-48117">かなかつた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48117-48132"><rb>中</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48132-48138">に、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48138-48159"><rb>貴女</rb><rt>あなた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-48159-48162">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-48162-48174">